WEBVTT

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:04.990
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:07.530
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:17.350
Note: White Day is one month after Valentine's Day, when boys who received chocolates from girls return the favor.

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:09.530
Today is White Day!

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:13.820
But Amu-chan didn't give chocolates to anyone, so why does it matter?

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.350
Well, about that... Tadase is heading to your house, commoners.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.430
Honestly, a King shouldn't...

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:18.760
The Prince is coming?

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.180
T-This is bad!

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:22.740
It's even more exciting than usual!

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.020
Doki!

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:28.180
Yes! Yes!

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:31.100
Let's go!

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:34.110
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.900
Shugo, shugo! Yes!

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:45.600
Swing your arms! Hop, step, jump!

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:50.140
Now start marching straight ahead!

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:53.750
Way too awesome! Yes!

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:57.270
Every dream I've ever had!

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:02.980
Since they're all actually coming true.

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:09.100
What kind of person will I be today?

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:14.390
What counts is being true to yourself!

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:18.540
Going somewhere?

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.960
Take it to the finish!

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:24.450
You'll always be able to

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.390
unlock your heart.

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:30.350
So keep on changing!

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:32.760
It's so exciting!

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:40.890
Let's go forward, believing in our hearts!

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:43.620
Straight ahead!

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:45.280
Yeah! Yeah!

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:07.640
Good morning...

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:15.910
I can't believe I'm actually 
getting used to this. What's with me?

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:22.390
You know, you should be 
sleeping on the floor!

00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:23.820
I'm sick.

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:27.600
And besides, you're the 
one who dragged me here.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:33.660
Did she drag him here?

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:35.440
Wasn't it more like she picked up a stray?

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:37.720
She saved him!

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:41.370
Ikuto... Ikuto's in big trouble-nya!

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.990
Ikuto, what's wrong?

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:50.160
Amu...

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:53.460
Ikuto! This is bad! 
He's not breathing-nya!

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:56.270
Don't just kill me off...

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:03.980
Well, anyway, you can't stay here like this.

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:07.300
If you don't have anywhere to go, 
how about coming back to my place?

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:10.520
So I said, but...

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:15.940
I really did pick up a stray, didn't I?

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:21.770
Episode 74
An Exciting White Day!

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:24.600
Thanks for the food!

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:28.390
Mmm! Today's breakfast is yummy!

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:30.080
Yum-

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:32.680
I hate gween peppers!

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:36.230
If you don't eat your green peppers, 
you won't grow up big and strong.

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:40.580
Well, I wouldn't mind it if my Ami-chan 
never grew up and stayed just as she is.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:44.040
Honey...

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:44.570
I-I'm sorry...

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:45.800
I'm finished.

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:48.660
I think growing up is cute, too...

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:03.850
Amu-chan?

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:05.800
Yes?

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:08.140
What are you doing?

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:11.790
Ah, well, I was just thinking that 
breakfast didn't quite fill me up.

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:13.550
So, can I have these?

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:16.820
Sure... But a banana and dried sardines?

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:18.640
Right, for calcium!

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:22.900
They say that Japanese people don't 
get enough calcium these days, you know! {I don't think the note is necessary. They can look it up or use their brains and figure it out}

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:32.660
Dried sardines-nya!

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:42.750
Here, a banana. 
You can eat it like this, right?

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:46.580
You're not going to eat?

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:49.810
Do you suppose he's never 
eaten a banana before?

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:51.820
You have to peel it.

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:53.860
He can eat bananas-nya.

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:58.350
But bananas aren't suited 
for cats, so maybe...

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:16.370
Not hungry? Are you feeling okay?

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:18.590
Sure, I had a good sleep.

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:19.600
But...

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.960
I just don't want to end 
up all fat and jiggly like you.

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:28.200
I am not fat!

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:33.540
Tadase.

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:38.530
There's still quite a lot of Valentine's Day chocolates left...

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:41.750
They're such gracious gifts, we must eat them all.

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:04.630
Hey.

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:05.590
What?!

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:07.080
Do you have the next issue of this?

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:09.310
No! That's the current one!

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:12.420
Amu-chan sure is preoccupied with Ikuto, isn't she?

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:15.750
She seems to be having some 
difficulty focusing on her studies...

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:19.080
Well, she's no good at 
that even without Ikuto here.

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:20.960
What is it?!

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.890
What's the matter, 
Amu-chi? Are you angry?

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:28.410
Sorry, Yaya. There's just 
some stuff going on...

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.950
So, what is it?

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:34.770
I was about to check out a sale 
and was thinking we could go together!

00:06:34.770 --> 00:06:36.060
A sale?!

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:39.350
Today's not good for me...

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:42.720
But the other day you 
said you wanted to go!

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:45.220
I-I know, but...

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:47.060
There are... extenuating circumstances.

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:52.500
Huh? What, what?!

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:57.600
So there you have it! 
Too bad, sorry, gotta go now!

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:02.450
What're you looking at me for?

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:04.400
It's nothing!

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:07.460
S-Scary-nya...

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:18.150
Kiseki, don't you think the 
view is just brilliant today?

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:20.850
Really? It seems the same to me.

00:07:22.990 --> 00:07:25.780
Hotori-kun, heading somewhere?

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:26.970
Fujisaki-kun.

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:29.740
Yeah, I'm just...

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:34.270
Could that be for White Day?

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:40.540
If I'm not mistaken, this way is toward...

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:42.830
Please don't! It's not like that!

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:44.020
S-See you!

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:57.350
So you've finally made your decision.

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:08.910
That's about enough outta-

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:10.100
Sis!

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:13.220
W-What is it?

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:19.420
I found you!

00:08:19.420 --> 00:08:21.820
It's da Super Kitty Character!

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:27.230
Super, super!

00:08:26.510 --> 00:08:29.040
Stop it-nya! Let me go.

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:31.670
Um, Ami, what did you want?

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:33.480
Oh, right!

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:36.660
Amu-chan, did you invite 
a boy over to our house?!

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:37.970
The jig's up already?!

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:49.340
Amu-chan, you have a guest.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:50.580
Tadase-kun...

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:52.040
Hello.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:54.040
He's a guest, see?

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:55.680
So you invited him!

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:59.040
N-No! I won't allow this!

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:01.510
Now, honey, Amu-chan is of that age.

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:03.530
O-Of what age?!

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:05.730
I won't allow it! It's too soon!

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:09.390
I'll die before I'll tell him about Ikuto...

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:11.940
What brings you here so suddenly?

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:14.390
Um...

00:09:14.390 --> 00:09:19.480
Well, why don't you two take your time and have a chat over some tea in Amu's room.

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:22.010
What are you saying, darling?!

00:09:22.010 --> 00:09:24.530
I'm being an inconvenience, aren't I?

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:26.640
No, not in the slightest!

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:29.140
In fact, I'm over the moon!

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:30.140
But!

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:32.430
Where are you going?

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:33.890
To clean my room!

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:44.260
What are you doing?

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:45.780
Not a peep.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:56.630
P-Please come in, Tadase-kun! 
Sorry about the mess...

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:04.900
Your room is really trendy and cute.

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:06.490
It's just like you, Hinamori-san.

00:10:06.490 --> 00:10:08.130
Y-You think?

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:10.150
Yeah. It's really great.

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:12.010
I wonder what he came here for.

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:14.630
Could it finally be...

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:17.220
You mean, an exciting development?

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:19.560
What's so exciting? What are you talking about?

00:10:21.740 --> 00:10:26.030
This can't be true! My beloved 
Prince is actually in my room!

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:28.470
This situation is just like a dream!

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:30.140
And yet!

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:34.030
I can't relax and savor 
it even one bit...

00:10:54.860 --> 00:10:56.880
What's wrong with Daddy?

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:59.460
He can't do anything about it, 
so all he can do is run around.

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:03.880
I can't believe there's 
a boy in Amu-chan's room!

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:27.350
Was that a cat?

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:29.640
Uh, they're just making animal noises!

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:31.510
Ran, you're good!

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:40.130
I am <i>so</i> going 
to kick his butt later.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:41.320
Is something the matter?

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:43.450
N-No, nothing at all!

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:46.070
So anyway, Tadase-kun, 
why'd you come over today?

00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:47.600
Right...

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:51.970
Here.

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:54.240
For me?

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:55.080
Yeah.

00:11:57.220 --> 00:11:59.510
Today is March 14th!

00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:01.310
It's White Day!

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:06.270
But... Remember, on Valentine's Day...

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:09.690
Well, I actually made 
some chocolates, you see...

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:12.720
And I was thinking of 
giving them to you, Tadase-kun.

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:19.910
But it looks like I dropped them somewhere 
when I was chasing after Yukina-chan.

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:21.930
Oh, I see. That's too bad.

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:25.910
I was looking forward to your 
chocolates, Hinamori-san.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:28.430
R-Really?

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:29.350
Yeah.

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:33.390
So for White Day, you didn't have to...

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:37.350
I'm just showing my appreciation for 
the chocolates you planned to give me.

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:43.890
Thank you...

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:52.720
In truth, she really wanted Tadase-kun 
to eat those chocolates.

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:55.350
She even decorated them with a "K" for King.

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:08.770
But White Day is just an excuse.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:12.030
I'm just going to come out and say it.

00:13:12.490 --> 00:13:14.920
Hinamori-san, do you remember...

00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:20.930
I had two things I wanted to talk to you about the 
night before our final battle with Utau-chan.

00:13:20.930 --> 00:13:25.300
The first was about my connection 
to Utau-chan and Ikuto.

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:26.920
But the second...

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:30.230
Back then...

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:33.860
It was a pretty long time ago. 
I'd almost forgotten.

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:37.880
I never finished what I 
wanted to say that night.

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:41.710
And even though Sanjo-kun beat me to it...

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:43.020
Kairi?

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:49.350
The timing just never seemed right. As I tried 
to figure out when, the days kept passing by.

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:52.330
And it became harder and harder to say anything.

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:10.180
I don't know if I can express my feelings well, but would you be willing to hear me out?

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:11.270
Sure...

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:20.560
A while ago, I opened up to you and told you 
I was in love with Amulet Heart, remember?

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:25.710
She suddenly appeared before me.

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:29.180
We were both Guardians, so I felt it was wrong.

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:31.770
But I couldn't forget about her.

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:34.770
Could he mean...

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.900
I'm just going to say it, Hinamori-san!

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:39.360
Y-Yes!

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:45.810
It was the first time I'd ever seen 
a girl so bright, cheerful, and strong!

00:14:45.810 --> 00:14:47.600
A girl like Amulet Heart!

00:14:50.460 --> 00:14:51.250
What?

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:55.620
Oh yeah, that did happen, didn't it?

00:14:55.620 --> 00:15:02.950
Back then, it was just that Amulet Heart 
was so bright she dazzled my eyes.

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:07.790
I couldn't quite see the connection 
between her and the girl "Hinamori Amu."

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:13.440
Even though they're one and the same...

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:18.880
I failed to realize it, 
though it should've been obvious.

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:26.430
But, as I've spent more time with you, 
I've gradually come to understand.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:31.840
Amulet Heart is really a part of you.

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:39.660
When you confessed to me that first day...

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:41.970
I flatly turned you down.

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:48.910
And after that, I said I'd fallen in love with another side of you.

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:52.070
I ended up hurting you twice.

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:55.560
So... I want to apologize.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:16:00.660
O-Oh, that's all stuff from a long time ago! 
Don't worry about it, no p-prob!

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:05.790
Things are different now.

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:12.350
No matter what form you take, I want 
to gaze into your eyes the same way.

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:22.010
Right now, I'm not the strong person 
I am when I Character Change.

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:24.770
But I want to say this... if you'll let me!

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:32.960
Even like I am right now...

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:35.110
Will you let me fall in love with you?

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:53.000
Well said, Tadase!

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:58.270
I-I'm sorry! Blurting something like that out... 
I'm being a bother, aren't I?

00:16:58.270 --> 00:16:59.470
N-Not at all!

00:17:01.140 --> 00:17:03.480
You surprised me a little, is all.

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:07.270
It's just... I've always admired you.

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:10.110
Even after you turned me down.

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:15.140
So, to be honest... I'm really happy.

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:17.260
Promise?

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:20.250
Yeah.

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:36.400
I'm really happy, too.

00:17:37.730 --> 00:17:39.200
Yeah...

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:44.090
So am I.

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:49.380
Thank you for listening.

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:52.800
Thank you.

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:59.850
Good night!

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:03.360
Whoa, is Amu-chan okay?

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:05.310
I. Am. Okay.

00:18:06.220 --> 00:18:09.080
Not surprising, after what 
happened this afternoon.

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:10.710
That's true.

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:13.390
Anyway, why are you sleeping 
here with us, Yoru?

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:15.710
Why not-nya?

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:21.780
Tadase-kun said something like that to me...

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:26.890
Even like I am right now-

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:29.640
Will you let me fall in love with you?

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:32.790
You were eavesdropping?!

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:37.680
I couldn't help it. I was stuck here 
when he blurted it out.

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:39.020
B-Blurted?!

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:40.520
It was totally casual!

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:43.300
You seemed to like it well enough.

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.940
Well...

00:18:44.940 --> 00:18:46.520
Hey, why are you in my bed?

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:48.100
You get the floor!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.470
But it's so cold.

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:51.180
I don't care! Get the heck out!

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:55.370
When you say it like that, I don't want to.

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:00.510
So warm...

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:02.890
A child's body temperature is rather high.

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:05.670
Like a human hot-water bottle.

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:09.270
Whatever!

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:10.180
Ikuto!

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:12.440
Ow...

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:12.440
Are you okay, Ikuto?

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:14.800
Good night! Ran, the light!

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.560
'Kay...

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:33.760
So much stuff happened today, my head's spinning.

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:45.210
Didn't I tell you to 
sleep on the floor?!

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:47.760
But the floor is hard and cold...

00:19:47.760 --> 00:19:49.840
Give me a break! Get out!

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:52.130
I'm sick...

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:55.720
Your legs are cold!

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:58.020
Ah, I'm about to freeze to death.

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:57.280
Wait just a second!

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:02.420
Serves you right!

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:11.190
So anyway, that violin is 
important to you, right?

00:20:11.190 --> 00:20:12.990
Just a memento from my parents.

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:16.930
And here I thought it meant a lot to you...

00:20:16.930 --> 00:20:19.330
I don't even remember their faces.

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:23.180
Even though my stepdad is annoying, 
it's better not being related.

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:28.750
Being related by blood is just a nuisance, 
as far as I'm concerned.

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:35.070
The reason I've been always been chained to Easter
is to compensate them for the things my real dad did.

00:20:35.070 --> 00:20:36.020
Is that true?

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:47.540
So to Ikuto, his father is just...

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:52.470
What about the Key? Is the Dumpty Key a memento, too?

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:57.030
Man, this is boring. Who cares about any of this stuff?

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:02.810
I think you're just going 
through a rebellious phase.

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:08.060
You always treat me like a kid, 
but you're really just a kid yourself.

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:16.710
So Tadase loves you...

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.990
Huh? Why bring that up?

00:21:18.990 --> 00:21:22.390
You love someone, too, don't you?

00:21:22.930 --> 00:21:24.430
I do.

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:25.890
You.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:33.300
I hate people who lie.

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:36.760
Aww, sounds like she doesn't 
believe me at all.

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:40.030
Of course I don't! 
You're always teasing me.

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:42.390
Guess I'm just the boy who cried wolf.

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:51.870
Hey...

00:21:52.590 --> 00:21:53.720
What?

00:21:57.320 --> 00:21:59.030
Never mind. I don't think I will.

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:02.330
Grow up already, would you?

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:04.780
What's that supposed to mean?

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:26.270
We'll walk this path,

00:22:26.270 --> 00:22:30.060
no matter what may happen.

00:22:30.390 --> 00:22:34.350
Because when we combine our strength,

00:22:34.350 --> 00:22:38.270
something's bound to change!

00:22:46.140 --> 00:22:53.580
You're always so quick to say "absolutely,"

00:22:54.090 --> 00:22:57.950
but shouldn't you think it through a bit first?

00:22:58.320 --> 00:23:01.330
Can't you at least do that???

00:23:02.400 --> 00:23:06.080
You know, I'm starting to understand

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:09.540
the delicate movements of the heart.

00:23:09.980 --> 00:23:17.000
My own abilities aren't really all that special...

00:23:18.310 --> 00:23:22.300
But even if the first shot's off the mark

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:26.170
the third'll bravely hit the bull's-eye!

00:23:28.280 --> 00:23:32.260
We'll walk this path,

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:35.880
even if it's a steep climb.

00:23:36.340 --> 00:23:40.350
Because when we put our hearts together

00:23:40.350 --> 00:23:44.300
something definitely changes!

00:23:50.250 --> 00:23:53.260
I can't believe it... 
Tadase-kun said he...

00:23:53.260 --> 00:23:55.890
L-L-Loves me!

00:23:57.030 --> 00:23:59.560
Isn't that wonderful, Amu-chan?

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:02.350
But it doesn't look like 
you have time to celebrate.

00:24:02.350 --> 00:24:05.260
It's been a while, 
but that person is back!

00:24:05.260 --> 00:24:06.950
Utau? Why is she coming to my house?

00:24:06.950 --> 00:24:09.760
Did she find out about Ikuto?!

00:24:09.760 --> 00:24:11.860
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:11.860 --> 00:24:14.250
The Jig is Up!? Utau Pays a Visit!

00:24:14.250 --> 00:24:15.300
At a time like this...

00:24:15.300 --> 00:24:18.130
Calm down and eat some ramen.

00:24:18.130 --> 00:24:19.380
Ramen?
